  63:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c **** /*
  64:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c ****  * Convert angle (degrees) to PWM pulse width (microseconds)
  65:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c ****  * Uses linear mapping from calibrated servo datashee:
  66:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c ****  *   pulse_us = min_pulse_us + (angle - 0) * (max_pulse_us - min_pulse_us) / 270
  67:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c ****  * 
  68:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c ****  * Parameter: angle_deg - desired angle in degrees [0, 270]
  69:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c ****  * Return: PWM compare value in microseconds [500, 1315]
  70:Glider-Core/servo_driver.c ****  */
